       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. AddUser.


       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT UsersFile ASSIGN TO
                   "/home/stockjobber/service/USERS.DAT"
                   ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD UsersFile.
       01 STORED_CREDENTIALS.
           02 STORED_BANKNAME PIC A(20).
           02 STORED_USERNAME PIC A(10).
           02 STORED_PASSWORD PIC 9(10).
           02 STORED_AUTHLEVEL PIC S9(2).

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TPWD PIC 9(10).

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 BANKNAME PIC A(20).
       01 USERNAME PIC A(10).
       01 PASSWORD PIC 9(10).
       01 AUTHLEVEL PIC S9(2).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BANKNAME, USERNAME, PASSWORD, AUTHLEVEL.
       10Start.
           MOVE BANKNAME TO STORED_BANKNAME
           MOVE USERNAME TO STORED_USERNAME
           MOVE FUNCTION MOD(PASSWORD, 100) TO TPWD
           CALL "RSA" USING 0016847419 0000000005 TPWD STORED_PASSWORD
           MOVE AUTHLEVEL TO STORED_AUTHLEVEL

           OPEN EXTEND UsersFile.
           WRITE STORED_CREDENTIALS
           DISPLAY "Added user.".
           CLOSE UsersFile.
       GOBACK.
